* Pinned ngspice system start-up script for evidence-producing harness runs.
*
* The harness points SPICE_SCRIPTS at this directory and passes -n, so the
* installed system spinit, the user ~/.spiceinit and a work-directory
* .spiceinit are not read (see sim/README.md, "ngspice start-up
* configuration", and sim/tool-experiments/2026-10-11-ngspice-startup-config/).
*
* Deliberately empty of commands: no aliases, no code-model or OSDI loading.
* Harness decks use built-in device models only. Changing this file changes
* its SHA-256, which every new evidence record carries.
